Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was damn drunk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So what? Not everyone gets to coast along in the easy lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad died in the war when I was little. Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister Li...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Elisabeth! My sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She has character. She can do anything. Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've never understood that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why Lisa told Mom to go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.74,0:00:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause you're cute and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.40,0:00:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't I get a kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.76,0:01:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I need a bit of a shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
